  "content": "<center>\n\t<img style=\"width: 1142px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/wordmarks/outlined/cracked/f32_wordmark.png\">\n\t<h1>Minecraft 32x纹理资源的首选。</h1>\n\t<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/addons/faithful-32x-bedrock\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img\n\t\t\tstyle=\"width: 1142px;\"\n\t\t\tsrc=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/bedrock_button.png\"\n\t\t\talt=\"在此获取基岩版资源包\"\n\t\t>\n\t</a>\n</center>\n<hr>\n<p>\n    独一无二的Faithful 32x采用现代、精细的艺术风格，专注于重新构想纹理而非简单重绘，充分利用了更高分辨率。其显著特点包括有限的调色板和对一致性的追求。\n\t<br><br>\n    该资源包多年来经历了巨大演变。自2010年由Vattic最初创建以来，它已成为一种文化标志，被数百万Minecraft玩家所喜爱。准备好成为其中一员了吗？\n\n</p>\n<center>\n\t<a href=\"https://discord.gg/sN9YRQbBv7\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img style=\"width: 1142px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/discord_button.png\" alt=\"Discord服务器\">\n\t</a>\n  <br><br>\n\t<a href=\"https://faithfulpack.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img style=\"width: 1142px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/website_button.png\" alt=\"网站\">\n\t</a>\n</center>\n<hr>\n<center><h2>其他信息：</h2></center>\n<p>\n\t如果您有任何反馈、想要报告错误或一般需要帮助，请加入我们上方的<a href=\"https://discord.gg/sN9YRQbBv7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Discord</a>服务器，提交<a href=\"https://github.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Faithful-32x-Java/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub问题</a>，或在下方评论。有关商业或分发相关问题，请参阅我们的<a href=\"http://faithfulpack.net/license\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">许可协议</a>。\n\t<br><br>\n    所有纹理和附加组件均由贡献者利用业余时间自愿提供。任何人都可以通过我们上面链接的Discord服务器提交纹理，或制作<a href=\"http://faithfulpack.net/addons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">附加组件</a>以在我们的网站上正式列出。开始之前，请务必阅读我们的<a href=\"https://docs.faithfulpack.net/pages/textures/f32-texturing-guidelines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">纹理制作指南</a>，其中精确概述了该资源包的艺术风格。\n\t<br><br>\n    每个资源包均在我们的<a href=\"faithfulpack.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">网站</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/faithful_resource_pack/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CurseForge</a>、<a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/faithful_resource_pack/submissions/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Planet Minecraft</a>和<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Faithful-Resource-Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Modrinth</a>上列出，部分资源包还额外在<a href=\"https://mcpedl.com/user/faithful-resource-pack/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">MCPEDL</a>和<a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/members/Faithful_Resource_Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Minecraft论坛</a>上发布。<strong>从其他任何网站下载均是非官方、不受支持的，且可能存在危险！</strong>请务必在互联网上保持警惕。\n</p>\n<hr>\n<center><h2>我们的其他项目：</h2></center>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n\t<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/faithful-64x\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img\n\t\t\tstyle=\"width: 1142px;\"\n\t\t\tsrc=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/f64_button.png\"\n\t\t\talt=\"Faithful 64x\"\n\t\t>\n\t</a>\n\t<br><br>\n\t<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/classic-faithful-32x\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img\n\t\t\tstyle=\"width: 1142px;\"\n\t\t\tsrc=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf32_button.png\"\n\t\t\talt=\"Classic Faithful 32x\"\n\t\t>\n\t</a>\n\t<br><br>\n\t<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/classic-faithful-32x-jappa\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img\n\t\t\tstyle=\"width: 1142px;\"\n\t\t\tsrc=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf32j_button.png\"\n\t\t\talt=\"Classic Faithful 32x Jappa\"\n\t\t>\n\t</a>\n\t<br><br>\n\t<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-64x\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img\n\t\t\tstyle=\"width: 1142px;\"\n\t\t\tsrc=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf64j_button.png\"\n\t\t\talt=\"Classic Faithful 64x Jappa\"\n\t\t>\n\t</a>\n</div>",
